Topic 16 – Abstraction
Objective: Abstract classes, abstract methods, concrete methods and implementation.
No.	Program	Requirement
01	Abstract Animal Class	Create an abstract class Animal with an abstract method sound(). Implement it in a Dog class.
02	Abstract Vehicle Class	Create an abstract class Vehicle with abstract method start() and concrete method stop().
03	Employee Abstraction	Create abstract class Employee with abstract method calculateSalary(). Implement it in two child classes.
04	Shape Abstraction	Create abstract class Shape with abstract method calculateArea(). Implement Circle and Rectangle.
05	Abstract Class with Constructor	Create an abstract class with a constructor and demonstrate how the constructor is invoked through a child object.
06	Abstract Class with Fields	Create an abstract class with instance variables, a constructor and concrete methods. Access them through a child class.
07	Multiple Abstract Methods	Create an abstract class containing three abstract methods and implement all three in the child class.
08	Abstract Class with Partial Implementation	Create an abstract class with two abstract methods and two concrete methods. Implement only the abstract methods in the child class.
09	Browser Abstraction	Create an abstract Browser class with abstract launch() and close() methods. Implement them in Chrome and Firefox classes.
10	Automation Base Class	Create an abstract BaseTest class with abstract executeTest() and concrete setup and teardown methods. Implement it in LoginTest and SearchTest.